Third-party notices for src/romeo.c / src/romeo.h (niimath `-romeo`)
====================================================================

src/romeo.c is a C port of the Julia sources listed below.  Each is MIT-licensed; the
original copyright and permission notices are reproduced verbatim, as the MIT licence
requires.  The pinned reference versions are recorded at the top of src/romeo.c.

Algorithm citation (please cite when using `-romeo`):
  Dymerska, B., Eckstein, K., Bachrata, B., Siow, B., Trattnig, S., Shmueli, K.,
  Robinson, S.D., 2020. "Phase Unwrapping with a Rapid Opensource Minimum Spanning TreE
  AlgOrithm (ROMEO)." Magnetic Resonance in Medicine.  https://doi.org/10.1002/mrm.28563


