3. The Julia programming language standard library  (https://github.com/JuliaLang/julia)
   Ported: base/math.jl (rem2pi, add22condh) and base/special/rem_pio2.jl
           (rem_pio2_kernel, cody_waite_*, paynehanek, fromfraction), needed because
           Julia's rem2pi uses an infinitely precise 2*pi and libc remainder() does not.
   The rem_pio2_kernel and cody_waite_* routines are themselves derived from FDLIBM's
   __ieee754_rem_pio2; the Sun Microsystems notice follows the Julia licence.
